{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>以下是一段影片，攝於週五於五角大樓舉行的九一一事件25週年紀念儀式上，片中為總統Donald Trump。</p>\n<p>以下是部分照片：</p>\n<img src=\"https://img.huffingtonpost.com/asset/6aa446723c000049844e6e6f.jpeg?cache=BOviB0ggk0&amp;ops=scalefit_720_noupscale\"/>\n<img src=\"https://img.huffingtonpost.com/asset/6aa452b33c0000b3874e6e75.jpeg?ops=scalefit_720_noupscale\"/>\n<img src=\"https://img.huffingtonpost.com/asset/6aa4465f170000bd5220134f.jpeg?ops=scalefit_720_noupscale\"/>\n<p>白宮發言人Davis Ingle向《HuffPost》發表聲明表示：「總統Trump神情莊重地聆聽並悼念在那天悲劇中失去生命的罹難者及英勇的急救人員。任何荒謬地聲稱總統睡著了的人都在說謊。」</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T19:39:10.088642+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":450,"images":3,"source":"HuffPost 新聞","fallback":"none"}}